{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "C547C2B5-A0FF-40D5-8BFD-C5F7931F8547",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## 草稿纸\n\n![handwriting](../assets/handwriting-52c6ff9b0f5c85116a5fdc61e74836cc.svg)",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/C547C2B5-A0FF-40D5-8BFD-C5F7931F8547",
      "color": "#FFFFFF"
    },
    {
      "id": "0BAB9458-C5BA-4D9C-AEC8-00D07643F429",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 312,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## 高等数学",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/0BAB9458-C5BA-4D9C-AEC8-00D07643F429",
      "color": "#FFFFFF"
    },
    {
      "id": "57B1F7D4-0476-4D41-B06B-A68C9461ABF1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 2181,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## 错题管理",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/57B1F7D4-0476-4D41-B06B-A68C9461ABF1",
      "color": "#FFFFFF"
    },
    {
      "id": "8D0C4214-38FA-419A-868D-FAE0D4756EBE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 580,
      "y": -459,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## 无标题卡片\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:28.0px 'PingFang SC';color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Semibold';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:28.00px\">基础知识</span></p>",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/8D0C4214-38FA-419A-868D-FAE0D4756EBE"
    },
    {
      "id": "349C45D2-45E9-477C-9EC1-7793598987A4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": -953,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 348,
      "text": "## 二项式定理; binomial theorem\n\n$$\n(x+y)^n=\\sum_{k=0}^n\\binom nkx^{n-k}y^k=\\sum_{k=0}^n\\binom nkx^ky^{n-k}\n$$\n其中每个 $\\binom nk$ 为一个称作二项式系数的特定正整数，其等于 $\\dfrac{n!}{k!(n-k)!}$\n\n#基础定理\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:18.0px 'PingFang SC';color:#ffffff;background-color:#009fff\"><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Semibold';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:18.00px\">参考：</span></p>\n\n[二项式定理（百度百科）](https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%BA%8C%E9%A1%B9%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%9A%E7%90%86/7134359?lemmaId=7078006&lemmaTitle=%E4%BA%8C%E9%A1%B9%E5%B1%95%E5%BC%80%E5%BC%8F&fromModule=lemma_inlink&bk_fr=chain_bottom&timestamp=1700312617229)\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:18.0px 'PingFang SC';color:#ffffff;background-color:#009fff\"><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Semibold';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:18.00px\">应用：</span></p>\n\nmarginnote4app://note/782AED95-476D-4D95-BB4B-2C6CC7A83F18",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/349C45D2-45E9-477C-9EC1-7793598987A4",
      "color": "#ADD2FF"
    },
    {
      "id": "CBEF59A7-7742-4A39-BDD1-B74BB2B5BA64",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": -581,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 276,
      "text": "## 向前向后数学归纳法\n\n![linked excerpt](../assets/87317ca8d24ac3d139f9d76cb8883711.png)\n\n1. （向前）先证明命题对无穷多个自然数 $n$ 成立\n2. （向后）再证明 $n=k+1$ 时可以推得 $n=k$ 时命题成立\n\n#基础方法\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:18.0px 'PingFang SC';color:#ffffff;background-color:#009fff\"><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Semibold';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:18.00px\">应用：</span></p>\n\n![handwriting](../assets/handwriting-4cbb355de96d90aed2299ebc19b86241.svg)",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/CBEF59A7-7742-4A39-BDD1-B74BB2B5BA64",
      "color": "#ADD2FF"
    },
    {
      "id": "D657CE42-4812-4B44-A28C-2F76FA3C43FE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": -459,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## 初等数学中的定理和方法",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/D657CE42-4812-4B44-A28C-2F76FA3C43FE",
      "color": "#ADD2FF"
    },
    {
      "id": "51BC3473-FFC7-40B8-9D39-A396DE5B833D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": -281,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 456,
      "text": "## 数学归纳法; Mathematical Induction\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:16.0px 'PingFang SC';color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Regular';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">最简单和常见的数学归纳法是证明当</span><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\"> $n$ </span><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Regular';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">等于任意一个自然数时某命题成立。证明分下面两步：</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:16.0px Helvetica;color:#000000;min-height:19.0px\"><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:16.0px Helvetica;color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\"><span>  </span></span><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px;color:#0000ff\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Regular';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">证明当</span><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\"> $n=1$ </span><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Regular';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">时命题成立。</span><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\"><br>\n</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:16.0px 'PingFang SC';color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\"><span>  </span></span><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px;color:#0000ff\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Regular';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">假设</span><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\"> $n=m$ </span><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Regular';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">时命题成立，那么可以</span><span style=\"font-family:'.SFNS-Bold';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px;color:#0000ff\">**</span><span style=\"font-family:'.PingFangSC-Semibold';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">推导</span><span style=\"font-family:'.SFNS-Bold';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px;color:#0000ff\">**</span><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Regular';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">出在</span><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\"> $n=m</span><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px;color:#0000ff\">+</span><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">1$ </span><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Regular';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">时命题也成立。（</span><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">$m$ </span><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Regular';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">代表任意自然数）</span><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\"><br>\n</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:16.0px Helvetica;color:#000000;min-height:19.0px\"><span style=\"font-family:'Helvetica';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:16.0px 'PingFang SC';color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Regular';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">这种方法的原理在于：首先证明在某个起点值时命题成立，然后证明从一个值到下一个值的过程有效。当这两点都已经证明，那么任意值都可以通过反复使用这个方法推导出来。</span></p>\n\n#基础方法\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:18.0px 'PingFang SC';color:#ffffff;background-color:#009fff\"><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Semibold';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:18.00px\">参考：</span></p>\n\n[数学归纳法（百度百科）](https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%BD%92%E7%BA%B3%E6%B3%95/5155524?fr=ge_ala)\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:18.0px 'PingFang SC';color:#ffffff;background-color:#009fff\"><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Semibold';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:18.00px\">应用：</span></p>\n\nmarginnote3app://note/A78DE51A-EE0F-463D-BEC2-DAD80D7E5651\n\n![handwriting](../assets/handwriting-d5752d2a4b8682a77a970b6354d841eb.svg)",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/51BC3473-FFC7-40B8-9D39-A396DE5B833D",
      "color": "#ADD2FF"
    },
    {
      "id": "2841E617-4126-4F2A-9C77-57A4F509B71D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 580,
      "y": 919,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## 无标题卡片\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:30.0px 'PingFang SC';color:#555555;background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Semibold';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:30.00px\">不等式</span></p>",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/2841E617-4126-4F2A-9C77-57A4F509B71D",
      "color": "#BEFFBE"
    },
    {
      "id": "D8A9E891-38E6-4D3B-8AB0-3C8E94D2A6D1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 436,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## 比较两个实数大小",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/D8A9E891-38E6-4D3B-8AB0-3C8E94D2A6D1",
      "color": "#FFFFAA"
    },
    {
      "id": "63C78706-8B15-4EF2-86D2-1ECCF9D26225",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 1403,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## 无标题卡片\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:28.0px 'PingFang SC';color:#555555;background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Semibold';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:28.00px\">不等式基本性质</span></p>",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/63C78706-8B15-4EF2-86D2-1ECCF9D26225",
      "color": "#FFFFAA"
    },
    {
      "id": "25999587-552E-45F0-A9D3-7D7147FD2D82",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 199,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 186,
      "text": "## 利用数轴与实数的一一对应进行比较\n\n由于数轴上的点与实数**一一对应**, 所以可以利用数轴上点的位置关系来规定实数的大小关系\n\n![linked excerpt](../assets/f801b60b2337a57b138a0e1f0a0bb141.png)\n\n#知识点",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/25999587-552E-45F0-A9D3-7D7147FD2D82",
      "color": "#ADD2FF"
    },
    {
      "id": "4233354A-23D4-4450-AFF6-21C3133CBE10",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 837,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## 大于等于和小于等于是对称的\n\n![excerpt](../assets/23c8b3219b52474a4a7a333be20eaa23.png)\n\n#知识点",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/4233354A-23D4-4450-AFF6-21C3133CBE10",
      "color": "#ADD2FF"
    },
    {
      "id": "AE2193D2-62F9-40D9-A904-FD9307CDA83A",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 1011,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 294,
      "text": "## 不等式两边同时乘以或除以相同的正数, 不改变不等号\n\n![excerpt](../assets/44b3c84bf3141c5cceaef2a65b1fb919.png)\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:16.0px 'PingFang SC';color:#ffffff;background-color:#009fff\"><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Semibold';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">应用：</span></p>\n\n#知识点\n\nmarginnote3app://note/FF5F4168-B147-48B4-A591-B3592B2D35EF\n\nmarginnote3app://note/A0EF744C-317D-4249-B871-0A90F442869A\n\nmarginnote3app://note/A78DE51A-EE0F-463D-BEC2-DAD80D7E5651",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/AE2193D2-62F9-40D9-A904-FD9307CDA83A",
      "color": "#ADD2FF"
    },
    {
      "id": "127B29D5-C359-49FC-9FAF-DDAE9B4E54DC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 1329,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## 不等式可以“相加”\n\n![excerpt](../assets/34a8ea09f60fe2037041626cfabf8f05.png)\n\n#知识点",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/127B29D5-C359-49FC-9FAF-DDAE9B4E54DC",
      "color": "#ADD2FF"
    },
    {
      "id": "42DCD2EC-54A8-4F9A-9D0D-08784BC2B0E1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 409,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "## 两个实数作差与0进行比较\n\n1. 如果 $a − b$ 是正数, 那么 $a > b$; \n2. 如果 $a − b$ 等于 $0$, 那么 $a = b$; \n3. 如果 $a − b$ 是负数那么 $a < b$.\n反过来也对.\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:16.0px 'PingFang SC'\"><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Regular';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">这就导出了证明不等式的比较法之一：差值比较</span></p>\n\n#知识点",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/42DCD2EC-54A8-4F9A-9D0D-08784BC2B0E1",
      "color": "#ADD2FF"
    },
    {
      "id": "A78DE51A-EE0F-463D-BEC2-DAD80D7E5651",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 1011,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 294,
      "text": "## 若 a ≥ b ≥ 0, 则 aⁿ ≥ bⁿ.\n\n![linked excerpt](../assets/6b6ea70ac6ef0a93b92ee36daa36f8f3.png)\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:16.0px 'PingFang SC';color:#ffffff;background-color:#009fff\"><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Semibold';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">原理：</span></p>\n\nmarginnote3app://note/AE2193D2-62F9-40D9-A904-FD9307CDA83A\n\nmarginnote3app://note/51BC3473-FFC7-40B8-9D39-A396DE5B833D\n\n![linked excerpt](../assets/ee811ed92fccca8cb45b2bf7ea164e03.png)\n\n#知识点",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/A78DE51A-EE0F-463D-BEC2-DAD80D7E5651",
      "color": "#ADD2FF"
    },
    {
      "id": "AD0AC2BB-93E6-4F3D-8732-084F7225751C",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 1503,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## 非负不等式可以“相乘”\n\n![excerpt](../assets/72bb4dca282d8ad10166c86e8dee6de0.png)\n\n#知识点",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/AD0AC2BB-93E6-4F3D-8732-084F7225751C",
      "color": "#ADD2FF"
    },
    {
      "id": "FF5F4168-B147-48B4-A591-B3592B2D35EF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2020,
      "y": 975,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 366,
      "text": "## 若 a ≥ b ≥ 0, 则 a² ≥ b².\n\n![linked excerpt](../assets/d6ee7d728b38231ef4eb6ee76b9d786c.png)\n\n![linked excerpt](../assets/ba3eb3619ded070dd7584d11fd018e81.png)\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:16.0px 'PingFang SC';color:#ffffff;background-color:#009fff\"><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Semibold';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">原理：</span></p>\n\nmarginnote3app://note/AE2193D2-62F9-40D9-A904-FD9307CDA83A\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:16.0px 'PingFang SC';color:#ffffff;background-color:#009fff\"><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Semibold';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">思考：</span></p>\n\n借助数学归纳法，可以推到一般的 $n$ 的情形\n\nmarginnote3app://note/A78DE51A-EE0F-463D-BEC2-DAD80D7E5651\n\n#知识点",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/FF5F4168-B147-48B4-A591-B3592B2D35EF",
      "color": "#ADD2FF"
    },
    {
      "id": "675B45BD-8939-4614-B401-FF58E7B08924",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2020,
      "y": 454,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## #例子\n\n![excerpt](../assets/537ed222afc6d912883380e90f1af328.png)\n\n![linked excerpt](../assets/895b19ae631292895fb97689740c1414.png)",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/675B45BD-8939-4614-B401-FF58E7B08924",
      "color": "#C39DE0"
    },
    {
      "id": "2E5DEBB5-7A81-4518-9788-768971BB7BE1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 1677,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 258,
      "text": "## 不等式两边同时加上或减去相同的实数, 不改变不等号\n\n![excerpt](../assets/6604b07cf4edd6086c00ca9eeff8f976.png)\n\n![linked excerpt](../assets/0f485bb10db4c498a0ee65440c1d3db1.png)\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:16.0px 'PingFang SC';color:#ffffff;background-color:#009fff\"><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Semibold';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">应用：</span></p>\n\n#知识点\n\nmarginnote3app://note/196D38EA-4950-4D33-8C9E-C4BE44DC008A",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/2E5DEBB5-7A81-4518-9788-768971BB7BE1",
      "color": "#ADD2FF"
    },
    {
      "id": "D9446D97-F085-4E3E-A1B0-CA8C8C748EDD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 673,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## 它们的差与 0 的大小",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/D9446D97-F085-4E3E-A1B0-CA8C8C748EDD",
      "color": "#FFAABE"
    },
    {
      "id": "6348FB55-D259-49D0-8C04-F92A1A24AF95",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2980,
      "y": 1065,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 186,
      "text": "## 若 a, b ≥ 0, 则 aⁿ ≥ bⁿ 可以得到 a ≥ b\n\n![linked excerpt](../assets/27c729f2bc3e2428d9d1d700a8c3e35c.png)\n\n#知识点\n\n![handwriting](../assets/handwriting-f17c1f04d5110aad6826e4f79e296025.svg)",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/6348FB55-D259-49D0-8C04-F92A1A24AF95",
      "color": "#FFAABE"
    },
    {
