      "type": "text",
      "x": 2020,
      "y": 1677,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 258,
      "text": "## 不等式可以“移项”\n\n![excerpt](../assets/ad5d828dfc254c2cd4adde99ba4cbb2c.png)\n\n![linked excerpt](../assets/dd85de033e75435f5cec1a7cd5f58428.png)\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:16.0px 'PingFang SC';color:#ffffff;background-color:#009fff\"><span style=\"font-family:'PingFangSC-Semibold';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:16.00px\">原理：</span></p>\n\n#知识点\n\nmarginnote3app://note/2E5DEBB5-7A81-4518-9788-768971BB7BE1",
      "ostraconMnUrl": "marginnote4app://note/196D38EA-4950-4D33-8C9E-C4BE44DC008A",
